TDVP K230 developer starter set

This package is an installation profile, not a private copy of programs or
libraries.  It installs the independently versioned archive, Git, GitHub CLI,
Python, Vim, Make, pkgconf, source-maintenance, and trace packages declared in
its Depends field.

After installing, verify:
  tar --version
  git --version
  gh --version
  python3 --version
  vim --version
  make --version
  pkg-config --version
  strace true
